  Columns we read (okey_*, uprc, satm, sprc, obid, oask, svol) are identical-named on v8. 3 v7-only
  cols (calcType, veSlope, timestamp_us) are dropped but unused -> pure table-name swap, no aliasing.
  Implemented via IMPLIED_QUOTE_TABLE + _build_quote_sql() + use_v8() in spdr_rock_order_functions.py.
