- Stock prices (getLivePrices/get_prints): v7 sranalytics.msgstockprintset is GONE. v8 source is
  srlive.msgstockprint (connect database='srlive'). It is a per-print STREAM (many rows/ticker) vs
  v7's one-row-per-ticker set -> must ORDER BY TIMESTAMP DESC + dedupe latest per ticker. Column
